{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38047","headline":"建谿滩波心目惊眩余平生溺奇境今则畏怯不暇因书二十八字 · 韩偓","name":"建谿滩波心目惊眩余平生溺奇境今则畏怯不暇因书二十八字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长贪山水羡渔樵，自笑扬鞭趁早朝。\n今日建谿惊恐後，李将军画也须烧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}